	(text "U1 pad 23 = XIAO bottom BAT+ pad. RB-00.6 electrical path: BAT+ pad -> AWG24 solid tinned Cu post (6 mm, soldered before mounting)\n-> plated Ø1.40 hole at board (68.335, 21.862) -> Ø3.00 B.Cu pad -> VBAT. It is NOT one of the 14 castellations.\nBAT- has no post: return via castellation pin 13 (GND). Bottom pads 15-22 (JTAG/EN/USB D+/-), 24 (GND0), 25 not soldered, no net.\nD4 / D5 (pads 5, 6) reserved, intentionally NC in RB-01 (no I2C parts instantiated)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4b116590-7e06-53ba-a469-cba490c01ec5")
	)
	(text "VBAT_SENSE -> D0 (ADC1): 1M/1M + 100 nF. Firmware stops acquisition below 3.30 V (LDO headroom)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "77532d13-ae9f-5929-b5b7-019df4b68d6d")
	)
	(text "USB_PRESENT -> D6 (GPIO43 = U0TXD, boot-log output): informational only, never a control input to AFE_EN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "92114d92-fc6d-574d-a925-3e371d47ca91")
	)
	(text "DESIGN INTENT (this sheet):\n- U1 = XIAO ESP32S3 plain, DNP for JLC; hand-soldered on 14 castellations + BAT+ post (RB-00.6).\n- XIAO 3V3 -> FB1 -> 10 uF + 100 nF -> DVDD_F (ADC DVDD, X1, pull-ups). DVDD never from AFE_3V0.\n- D6 = USB_PRESENT sense only (informational). Safety inhibit is hardware (Analog_Power_Interlock sheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 256.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f1ffefdd-e404-5062-b5ff-515ace64891d")
	)
	(text "BRAIN - Seeed XIAO ESP32S3 plain (PN 202003751), pin map frozen RB-00 / RB-00.5 / RB-00.6"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f87ff995-e968-55c8-b043-f82ac0ba3ffd")
	)
